Description: Sound Recorder for The Lunduke Computer Operating System
 Needle is a gtkmm-3 Sound Recorder whose chrome is Windows 95 sndrec32:
 green waveform, Rec/Stop/Play, WAV files, Pulse/ALSA input picker.
